   "reproduction": {
    "command": "In $TMPDIR/f1, with cfg/config.toml containing '[server] port = 49752' and home/api-token set to 'tok123' (no api-token.origin file): LIMITLESS_PORT=+49751 LIMITLESS_CONFIG_DIR=$PWD/cfg H=$PWD/home bun t.ts. The script prints resolveClientPort(), the daemon's Number(env)||49752, and apiTokenHeaders for the two ports.",
    "output": "client port 49752 daemon port 49751\n49752 { authorization: \"Bearer tok123\" }\n49751 {}"
